sequenceDiagram
  actor U as User
  participant APP as Mobile App
  participant API as Expense API
  participant BAL as Balance Service
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  U->>APP: Add shared expense
  APP->>API: POST /api/expenses
  API->>DB: Insert expense + splits
  API->>BAL: Refresh roomspace balance cache
  BAL->>DB: Recalculate balances
  DB-->>BAL: Computed data
  BAL-->>API: Updated summary
  API-->>APP: Success + updated balance
